     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation exercise-session-example</b></p><a name=\"exercise-session-example\"> </a><a name=\"hcexercise-session-example\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-irun-exercise-session.html\">Interoperability Run - exercise session</a></p></div><blockquote><p><b>Interoperability Run context</b></p><ul><li>eventType: <a href=\"CodeSystem-irun-event-type.html#irun-event-type-wgm\">Interoperability Run - event type: wgm</a> (HL7 Working Group Meeting)</li><li>eventName: HL7 Europe WGM Malaga 2026</li><li>phase: <a href=\"CodeSystem-irun-phase.html#irun-phase-during-run\">Interoperability Run - measurement phase: during-run</a> (During the run)</li><li>location: <a href=\"Location-malaga-course-example.html\">Malaga seafront run course</a></li></ul></blockquote><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category activity}\">Activity</span></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise run-session}\">Run session</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Patient-runner-example.html\">Alex Runner  Other, DoB: 1985-04-12 ( https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/bib#MLG26-042)</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-11-18 07:30:00+0100 --&gt; 2026-11-18 08:02:00+0100</p><p><b>device</b>: <a href=\"Device-wearable-example.html\">Device: manufacturer = Example Wearables Ltd; modelNumber = SW-1; type = Wrist-worn fitness tracker with heart rate, SpO2 and single-lead ECG</a></p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://loinc.org 55411-3}\">Exercise duration</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 32 min<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemin = 'min')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise distance}\">Distance run</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 5.2 km<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codekm = 'km')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise average-pace}\">Average pace</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 6.15 min/km<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemin/km = 'min/km')</span></p></blockquote></div>"
